00:49:24.206 --> 00:49:25.345 align:middle line:90%
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:49:25.345 --> 00:49:27.910 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: I'd see it as
in the middle, then.

00:49:27.910 --> 00:49:30.000 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: In EVE you have to
form corporations with bunches

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:33.450 align:middle line:84%
