to do anything.

00:49:33.450 --> 00:49:34.440 align:middle line:90%
PROFESSOR: That's true.

00:49:34.440 --> 00:49:39.403 align:middle line:84%
You have to be really good in
your social skills, actually.

00:49:39.403 --> 00:49:40.401 align:middle line:84%
It's one of the games that's
most ruthlessly

00:49:40.401 --> 00:49:41.651 align:middle line:90%
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:49:41.651 --> 00:49:43.730 align:middle line:90%


00:49:43.730 --> 00:49:44.050 align:middle line:90%
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:49:44.050 --> 00:49:46.110 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: If you interact
with the people

00:49:46.110 --> 00:49:47.340 align:middle line:90%
and the world a lot.

00:49:47.340 --> 00:49:50.800 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: I think it's more
strongly player attracting and

00:49:50.800 --> 00:49:53.080 align:middle line:84%
is world attracting
than most games.

00:49:53.080 --> 00:49:54.330 align:middle line:84%
PROFESSOR: You cannot
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:49:54.330 --> 00:49:57.360 align:middle line:90%


00:49:57.360 --> 00:50:01.770 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: But there's also a
huge amount of achievement and

00:50:01.770 --> 00:50:03.700 align:middle line:84%
