00:50:03.700 --> 00:50:04.776 align:middle line:90%
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:50:04.776 --> 00:50:08.190 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: You can die far down
the interacting scale.

00:50:08.190 --> 00:50:10.650 align:middle line:84%
I mean, consider things in
