00:50:14.560 --> 00:50:18.218 align:middle line:84%
the spectrum than EVE
Online, surely.

00:50:18.218 --> 00:50:20.906 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:50:20.906 --> 00:50:22.180 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: Assuming that
