00:58:19.100 --> 00:58:20.360 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: Occasionally.

00:58:20.360 --> 00:58:21.926 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: They don't have
a game that's been--

00:58:21.926 --> 00:58:24.625 align:middle line:90%
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:58:24.625 --> 00:58:25.460 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: It's like
a ridiculous

00:58:25.460 --> 00:58:26.870 align:middle line:90%
learning curve, yeah.

