AUDIENCE: It's like four
months or something.

00:58:29.220 --> 00:58:31.186 align:middle line:90%
It's insane.

00:58:31.186 --> 00:58:33.080 align:middle line:84%
PROFESSOR: But the interesting
thing about the particular

00:58:33.080 --> 00:58:36.278 align:middle line:84%
case where someone infiltrated,
