00:58:36.278 --> 00:58:41.710 align:middle line:84%
money and basically decimated
this clan deliberately, was

00:58:41.710 --> 00:58:44.540 align:middle line:84%
that that person
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:58:44.540 --> 00:58:45.790 align:middle line:90%
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:58:45.790 --> 00:58:47.360 align:middle line:90%


